completions_7:
1.  Calculate the number of messages James delivers to Mr. Yu. 2.  Add the number of messages delivered to Ms. Thompson and Mr. Yu.
James delivers 1/3 as many messages to Mr. Yu as he delivers to Ms. Thompson. Ms. Thompson receives 66 messages. So, James delivers (1/3) * 66 = 22 messages to Mr. Yu. To find the total number of messages, we add the number of messages delivered to Ms. Thompson and Mr. Yu. Total = 66 + 22 = 88.
\boxed{88}
